  "title": "What's taken now?",
  "does": "Each service was set at sign-up with what's taken before the visit. Exactly one of these happens, on the page, only with the price and the yes shown first.",
  "more": [
    "This is the one place that sets what this booking took. Every later message speaks of that, never of the service's setting.",
    "With several services, part paid now and part left is 'A deposit'. All of it paid now is 'The full price'.",
    "Nothing due now: 'A card saved' if any service needs a card, else 'Nothing taken'.",
    "A credit for the only service: 'Nothing taken', or 'A card saved' for extras where it asks a card.",
    "On a call, a card is typed on the keypad. Until that's set up, Sam is asked first (A5-08).",
    "Where the plug-in says money before the work can't go through Rosie, the deposit and full price are off for that work.",
    "Terms can differ for new and returning customers, as Sam set.",
    "Never: take money before the price and the yes to it, or more than the terms say.",
    "Plug-in silent: the money before Sam set for the service."
